title The first paid widening, and a type that was already in the signature
prompt Take the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first, Standfast on reds first, deep-read one council-rota row, send the finished increment
think Standfast first -- crux/REDS.md holds 143 rows and every one carries a CLOSED companion, so the line was clear and constructive work could open.
think The running thread from the top three log recommends is the Caravan ladder lift arc, and all three name judge_outcome as the next honest head at 468.
think Council rota row 3 (Water - Venus) read: Gall's Law, the happy zone and the thin edge, growing a language. Gall's warning against the from-scratch design landed directly on this arc -- the harness grew from a working one-family lift and the queue is walked one family per lap rather than folded whole.
think Measured the cohort at the head of the lap and wrote it to a file before touching the tree -- REDS %111's lesson, which arrived in a new costume one lap ago when a sweep list grepped after the harness edit matched the harness itself.
think All 37 bodies hash identically at d4af5771, all 37 Finished structs hash identically at 7854f36c, and run_of, outcome_name, Report, and RunError stand public in 37 of 37. Only Finished and the carry import stood private.
think The carry import is free: caravan/ladder_checks.rye imports carry.rye at its own head, so the lifted body reaches carry.Outcome.carried_ok directly rather than through the rung.
think The Finished opening is real and is paid. A type standing in a published signature must stand public beside it, and that is Zig's rule rather than a choice this arc made.
obs Nine consecutive free folds had made freedom look like the arc's normal state. The honest reading is narrower: those bodies reached helpers, and a helper the harness already imports costs nothing. This body reaches a type, and a type in a signature is a different kind of reach.
obs What the lift published was already offered. Every one of the thirty-seven rungs had long published a judge_outcome taking a Finished, so the type was reachable through the signature that named it. Opening the declaration spells out what the API already promised.
obs Both prose guards fired on this lap's own replacement sentences, and both were right. Five recited counts, none asserted in the file printing them. Two earned asserts off the scan's own output and three left the sentences, because the carry meter does not measure family widenings and had no business reciting them. A loom built one lap ago paid for itself on the next.
